---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PostList from '../components/PostList.astro';
import { getPosts, groupTags } from '../lib/posts';
const posts = await getPosts();
const tags = groupTags(posts);
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="intro">
    <div>
      <h1>写下来，<br />慢慢想<span class="title-dot">。</span></h1>
      <p>你好，我是 jking。<br />这里记录编程、系统与学习路上的一点思考。</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="intro-note" aria-label="博客简介">
      <p>生活也许不总是美好，<br />不如意时看看头顶的天空。</p>
      <a href="/about/">关于这个博客 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="recent-heading">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="recent-heading">最近的文字</h2><a href="/archives/">全部 {posts.length} 篇文章 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <PostList posts={posts.slice(0, 10)} />
    <div class="list-end"><a class="text-link" href="/archives/">去归档继续阅读 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><span>{tags.length} 个标签，{posts.length} 篇记录</span></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
